<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn why Bible Nexus shares simple, hopeful Christian content for everyday life."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">About us</p><h1>A peaceful place to meet hope in Scripture.</h1><p>Bible Nexus exists to make meaningful Christian reading clear, warm, and easy to share.</p></div></section><article class="article-body article-shell section"><h2>Faith in everyday words</h2><p>You should not need a theology degree to find comfort in the Bible. We write for ordinary people facing ordinary days—and days that feel anything but ordinary.</p><p>Our sermons, prayers, devotionals, studies, and reference pages aim for depth expressed simply.</p><h2>How we handle Scripture</h2><p>Bible references are checked carefully. When a quotation is used, its translation should be identified. Our default source is the public-domain World English Bible.</p></article></BaseLayout>
